     'At the foot of the legendary Matterhorn, Zermatt welcomes you to a postcard landscape where wooden chalets, snowy slopes and crystal-clear skies make an unforgettable alpine setting. Ski, stroll, or admire Europe’s most photogenic mountain in all its winter majesty.',
